description:
Join Indivisible East Bay at CA-12 Representative Lateefah Simon's Town Hall in Emeryville! Rep. Simon is fighting hard for us. Let's show up for her with our questions, issues and support!

(Note: Indivisible East Bay is NOT the official host of the Town Hall. Rep. Simon is! We are just mobilizing members and others to attend. PLEASE ALSO REGISTER HERE: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdWSmUgLWPlbXwsQThoyFGs5z5u7gTta8QgCgHKKPvSlrl4Gg/viewform to receive updates from Rep. Simon.)

TIMING: 5:00pm - Meet in line. Look for the Indivisible East Bay sign;
5:30pm - Doors open;
6:00pm - Event starts;
7:30pm - Expected finish

SEATING IS LIMITED. PLEASE ARRIVE EARLY (6PM) TO ENSURE YOU GET IN. WE MAY NOT BE ABLE TO HOLD SEATS.

Thanks and see you there!
